# Search the home for the user. Served by global_planner, called by vehicle_manager.
# The planner generates points to check, drives to them in turn, and stops
# when user_detection reports the user (found on /user_info).

# Goal
geometry_msgs/Polygon search_area   # map frame; empty = the whole known map
---
# Result
bool found
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped user_pose  # valid only if found
---
# Feedback
uint16 points_checked
uint16 points_remaining
